{"id":72770,"date":"2026-11-04T08:20:45","date_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:20:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72770"},"modified":"2026-11-04T09:32:16","modified_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:32:16","slug":"cross-sao-salvador","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/cross-sao-salvador\/","title":{"rendered":"5\u00ba Cross S\u00e3o Salvador 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">5\u00ba Cross S\u00e3o Salvador 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>5\u00ba Cross S\u00e3o Salvador 2027<\/strong> (V Cross S. Salvador \u2013 Os \u00cdlhavos) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>28 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, no cen\u00e1rio natural do <strong>Parque de Lazer da Murteira (Pinhal da Murteira)<\/strong>, junto ao hist\u00f3rico bairro da <strong>Vista Alegre<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>\u00cdlhavo<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Integrado nas comemora\u00e7\u00f5es do 50\u00ba anivers\u00e1rio da ACD \"Os \u00cdlhavos\", o evento inicia as partidas \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o e disputa a corrida principal \u00e0s <strong>11:00<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Desenhado num circuito de corta-mato com piso misto de pinhal e caminhos florestais dentro de uma \u00e1rea ambiental protegida da freguesia de <strong>S\u00e3o Salvador<\/strong>, o programa contempla cinco provas jovens graduadas por idade \u2014 <strong>400 m<\/strong> (Sub-10), <strong>800 m<\/strong> (Sub-12), <strong>1.000 m<\/strong> (Sub-14), <strong>1.400 m<\/strong> (Sub-16) e <strong>2.500 m<\/strong> (Sub-18) \u2014 antes do arranque da prova principal de <strong>5 km (5.000 m)<\/strong> destinada a Sub-20, Sub-23, Seniores e Veteranos.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado conjuntamente pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Salvador (\u00cdlhavo)<\/strong> e pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Desportiva \"Os \u00cdlhavos\"<\/strong>, o cross est\u00e1 aberto a atletas federados, clubes populares e agrupamentos de escolas, oferecendo inscri\u00e7\u00f5es gratuitas para todos os escal\u00f5es jovens, pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos cinco primeiros da geral masculina e feminina nos 5.000 m e T-shirt t\u00e9cnica comemorativa.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"di