 text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Cross Principal 5 km (Sub-20, Sub-23, Seniores e Veteranos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 28 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 24\/02\/2027 \u00e0s 23:59)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 5\u00ba Cross S\u00e3o Salvador 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O 5\u00ba Cross S\u00e3o Salvador \u2013 Os \u00cdlhavos realiza-se no domingo, 28 de fevereiro de 2027, no Parque de Lazer da Murteira (Pinhal da Murteira \/ Parque de Merendas da Vista Alegre), em \u00cdlhavo, distrito de Aveiro. O secretariado funciona no local das 08:30 \u00e0s 10:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e as dist\u00e2ncias de cada escal\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa come\u00e7a \u00e0s 09:30 com os Sub-18 Juvenis (+\/- 2.500 m), seguindo-se \u00e0s 09:55 os Sub-16 Iniciados (1.400 m), \u00e0s 10:10 os Sub-14 Infantis (1.000 m), \u00e0s 10:25 os Sub-12 Benjamins B (800 m) e \u00e0s 10:40 os Sub-10 Benjamins A (400 m). A prova principal de +\/- 5.000 m (Sub-20, Sub-23, Seniores e Veteranos I, II e III) parte \u00e0s 11:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o valor das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e at\u00e9 quando posso inscrever-me?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o abertas at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 do dia 24 de fevereiro de 2027. A participa\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 gratuita para todos os escal\u00f5es jovens (Benjamins A e B, Sub-14, Sub-16, Sub-18 e agrupamentos escolares). Para os escal\u00f5es de Sub-20, Sub-23, Seniores e Veteranos, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o tem o valor \u00fanico de 5,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta e quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios atribu\u00eddos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas dos escal\u00f5es Sub-20, Sub-23, Seniores e Veteranos recebem uma T-shirt t\u00e9cnica e garrafa de \u00e1gua, enquanto os atletas das camadas jovens recebem um pin oficial do clube. Na prova principal de 5.000 m h\u00e1 pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os 5 primeiros da Geral M\/F (100 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 60 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 40 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba, 25 \u20ac ao 4\u00ba e 20 \u20ac ao 5\u00ba), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us individuais e coletivos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem s\u00e3o as entidades organizadoras do 5\u00ba Cross S\u00e3o Salvador?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado em conjunto pela Junta de Freguesia de S\u00e3o Salvador (\u00cdlhavo) e pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Cultural e Desportiva \"Os \u00cdlhavos\", integrando as comemora\u00e7\u00f5es do 50\u00ba anivers\u00e1rio do clube.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"5\u00ba Cross S\u00e3o Salvador 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-28\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-28\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org